Mode (Direct, Full, Melody) open for the Ruach trainer; Go on keeps the run's mode; Separate still AI-Toolkit's. The Trainer's and the Mode's tips anew in eleven catalogs.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
