-"AI-Toolkit only (the studio's own trainer is Direct). Direct: no score, for songs made in Direct mode. Full (score) and Melody: the music half also learns to write a score first, transcribed from every song, for songs made in those modes.": "仅限 AI-Toolkit（工作室自己的训练器为直接）。直接：没有乐谱，用于直接模式生成的歌曲。完整（乐谱）和旋律：音乐一半还学会先写乐谱（从每首歌扒谱得到），用于这些模式生成的歌曲。",
+"Direct: no score, for songs made in Direct mode. Full (score) and Melody: the music half also learns to write a score first, transcribed from every song by the engine before the run, for songs made in those modes; half the steps go without it, so Direct is not forgotten.": "直接：没有乐谱，用于直接模式生成的歌曲。完整（乐谱）和旋律：音乐一半还学会先写乐谱（训练前由引擎从每首歌扒谱得到），用于这些模式生成的歌曲；一半的步骤不带乐谱，因此不会忘掉直接模式。",
 "Makes notes used in the recent window less likely. Default 1.005, almost off.\n✓ Leave it at 1.0–1.01.\n⚠ A score repeats by nature: choruses, bar patterns. Above 1.05 the penalty breaks the repeats the song needs, and the choruses stop matching each other.": "降低最近窗口中用过的音符的概率。默认 1.005，几乎关闭。\n✓ 保持在 1.0–1.01。\n⚠ 乐谱天生会重复：副歌、小节型。超过 1.05 时惩罚会破坏歌曲需要的重复，副歌彼此就对不上了。",
 "SheetSage2 writes this take's own sound down as a score (the server reads the take itself; nothing is uploaded), into the form for a cover: with chords, or the melody only, as chosen under Cover a recording. Good for a reading made in Direct mode, which has no score.": "SheetSage2 把这个录音自身的声音记成乐谱（服务器直接读取录音；不上传任何东西），放进表单用于翻唱：带和弦，或仅旋律，按“翻唱录音”中的选择。适合用直接模式做的、没有乐谱的朗读。",
 "For readings and songs that go on past their text: Whisper finds where the text ends, and the same take is rendered again from its own music codes cut there (+1.5 s). The same performance, without the returns and babble after the last line; only the sound stage runs.": "适用于超出文本还在继续的朗读和歌曲：Whisper 找到文本结束的位置，用在那里截断的它自己的音乐编码重新渲染同一个录音（+1.5 秒）。同样的演绎，去掉了最后一行之后的重复和呓语；只运行声音阶段。",
